# Images build from the repository root but need only the workspace and the
# Caddy configs: everything is excluded, then those are let back in.
# Never in an image: .env files and secrets, target/.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!proto/
!deploy/caddy/
crates/*/target/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.cred
